# GraphUptime

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphUptime } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphUptime
  title="example"
  from="example"
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `days` | `UptimeStatus[]` | `—` | — |
| `from?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `to?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `columns?` | `number` | `30` | — |
| `glyphs?` | `Glyphs` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `UptimeStatus`
- `GraphUptimeProps`
